OL,3,GNEWSAPre-loved uniforms save families
OL,4,A#69, says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of families saved money on
OL,7,Fschool uniforms this summer through a
OL,8,Fcharity scheme providing pre-loved and
OL,9,Fdonated clothing for free.
OL,11,FKatie Wilson, CEO of Clothing Coventry,
OL,12,Fsaid parents were able to select items
OL,13,Fthey needed and families saved an
OL,14,Faverage of #69 by going to its uniform
OL,15,Fevents that ran across three weeks.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
