OL,3,GNEWSAPre-loved uniforms save families
OL,4,A#69, says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilson said the average cost of a
OL,7,Fschool uniform is estimated at #249.58
OL,8,Fper child and that "remains a real
OL,9,Fchallenge" for many families, and the
OL,10,Fcharity has helped more than 2,700
OL,11,Fchildren prepare for the new school
OL,12,Fyear.
OL,14,F"Projects like this only happen because
OL,15,Fpeople give their time, resources and
OL,16,Fsupport - thank you to every volunteer
OL,17,Fwho joined us," she added.
